## Proposed Architecture

### Database Schema

| Table | Purpose | Key Fields |
|-------|---------|------------|
| `projects` | Project containers | `id`, `name`, `owner_id` |
| `files` | PSD/Spine references | `project_id`, `file_type`, `storage_path` |
| `feedback` | Comments/drawings | `file_id`, `guest_name`, `type`, `data`, `target_frame` |

### RLS Policies

| Table | Guest (Public) | Admin (Authenticated) |
|-------|----------------|----------------------|
| `projects` | SELECT | ALL |
| `files` | SELECT | ALL |
| `feedback` | SELECT, INSERT | SELECT, INSERT, DELETE |

### Storage

| Bucket | Provider | Access |
|--------|----------|--------|
| `project_assets` | TBD (Supabase/R2) | Public Read, Admin Write |
| `feedback-assets` | Cloudflare R2 | Public Read/Write (via presigned) |

### Edge Functions

| Function | Purpose |
|----------|---------|
| `r2-signer` | Generate presigned URLs for R2 uploads |

### Realtime

- Subscribe to `feedback` table `INSERT` events for live updates.

